= Heartland Government Dismissed

President [+ president +] has invoked the <i>Commonwealth intervention</i> to dismiss the Heartland government, citing its "ungovernable" state caused by the repeated failure to form a functioning government amidst escalating clashes between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>, the Banners, and other paramilitary groups. 

Although the action has decent justification behind it, rumor has it that President [+ president +] will install a <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> conservative as <i>Reichskommissar</i> for the foreseeable future.

- @surrender

@surrender
title: There is nothing we can do.
subtitle: This isn't worth dying over.
on-arrival: in_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; in_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; in_popular_front_heartland = 0; in_left_front_heartland = 0; in_marcher_majority_heartland = 0; in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; marcher_heartland = 0; heartland_leader = "Goodlake"; commons_marcher -= 3; commons_collectivist -= 3; disfavored_collectivist -= 3; disfavored_marcher -= 3; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; banner_militancy = banner_militancy/1.5; banner_strength -= 300; vanguard_banned = 1; vanguard_strength -= 100; vanguard_militancy -= 0.1; heartland_reichsexekution_timer = 12; next_election_time_heartland = time + 48; next_election_year_heartland = year + 4

DuFour appoints the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> Reynold Goodlake, who renounces his party affiliation, to govern over Heartland as a <i>Reichskommissar</i>, charged with dismantling the democratic systems we worked hard to build.

Future state elections have been postponed indefinitely, to be held only when the situation is deemed "stable enough."